%% HAND-CURATED. Race condition surfaced per plan §11: cert serial conflict response.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FactoryCLI
    participant Gateway
    participant DeviceService
    participant IntermediateCA
    participant PostgreSQL

    FactoryCLI->>Gateway: POST /v1/devices/register {serialNumber, hardware_revision, firmware_version} mTLS
    Gateway->>DeviceService: forward request
    alt serial_already_registered (unique violation)
        DeviceService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT devices … ON CONFLICT (serial_number)
        PostgreSQL-->>DeviceService: unique violation uq_devices_serial_number
        DeviceService-->>Gateway: 409 serial_already_registered
        Gateway-->>FactoryCLI: 409
    else mtls_auth_failed
        Gateway-->>FactoryCLI: 401 invalid factory credential
    else invalid_serial_format
        DeviceService-->>Gateway: 422 invalid_serial_format
        Gateway-->>FactoryCLI: 422
    else success
        DeviceService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT devices {status=factory_new, lifecycle_state=unassigned}
        PostgreSQL-->>DeviceService: device_id
        DeviceService-->>FactoryCLI: 201 {device_id}
    end

    FactoryCLI->>IntermediateCA: sign CSR (out-of-band, sys-15 / sys-13)
    IntermediateCA-->>FactoryCLI: signed X.509 cert and fingerprint
    FactoryCLI->>Gateway: POST /v1/factory/devices/:deviceId/certificate {certificate_pem}
    Gateway->>DeviceService: forward
    alt cert_fingerprint_conflict
        DeviceService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT device_certificates ON CONFLICT (certificate_fingerprint) DO NOTHING
        PostgreSQL-->>DeviceService: 0 rows affected (duplicate)
        DeviceService-->>FactoryCLI: 201 (idempotent — duplicate cert silently accepted)
    else success
        DeviceService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT device_certificates {status=active, issued_at, expires_at}
        PostgreSQL-->>DeviceService: cert_id
        DeviceService-->>FactoryCLI: 201
    end

    Note over FactoryCLI,PostgreSQL: timeout 10s p99 · factory CLI retries on 5xx · idempotent register via ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING on cert fingerprint (Sprint 2)
